  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Services Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Servicios Agropecuarios</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa es fortalecer el ncleo de servicios agropecuarios que proveen acceso a la tecnologa productiva aplicada correspondiendo a oportunidades del mercado, mientras que reduzcan los riesgos de amenazas a la sanidad agropecuaria y a la inocuidad de alimentos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program objective is to stengthen the core public agricultural services that provide access to applied production technology corresponding to market opportunites, while reducing the risks derived from threats to plant and animal health and food safety. This in turn will contribute to the broader goal to enhance the competitive prodcuteve base upon which Belizeans can increase their incomes.</narrative>
  </description>
